# Citation metadata, in Citation File Format 1.2.0.
# GitHub renders this as "Cite this repository".
#
# The published release has no DOI. `version` and `date-released` make a
# citation unambiguous about what it saw.
#
# `license` is the code license. Datasets minted from this repository carry
# CC-BY-4.0, which is recorded in LICENSE-DATASETS.md and written into every
# manifest. The format has one license field, so this is the one it holds.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: 'Mintmark: deterministic synthetic Turkish labeled datasets'
abstract: A generation engine for fully synthetic, Turkish-first labeled datasets. Every value
  is derived from a seed by a deterministic function with no model anywhere in the generation
  path, spans are labeled against a pinned eighteen-label taxonomy, and each dataset carries
  a manifest that lets anyone re-derive the identical bytes. Code is Apache-2.0; datasets
  minted from any pack in this family carry CC-BY-4.0.
type: software
version: 0.3.4
date-released: 2026-09-05
authors:
- family-names: Guner
  given-names: Fatih
  alias: fatihguner
repository-code: https://github.com/lokomotifai/mintmark
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- synthetic data
- Turkish
- named entity recognition
- KVKK
- personal data detection
- reproducibility
- provenance
